[{"id":"MjE3-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara senyawa oksida nitrogen berikut ini, yang mengandung 36,4% massa oksigen adalah<br />","choices":["<img alt=\"\\text{NO}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BNO%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text{N}_{2}\\text{O}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BN%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%7BO%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text{N}_{2}\\text{O}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BN%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%7BO%7D_%7B3%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text{N}_{2}\\text{O}_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BN%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%7BO%7D_%7B4%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\text{N}_{2}\\text{O}_{5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BN%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%7BO%7D_%7B5%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODg5Ng"},{"id":"MjE3-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Untuk mengoksidasi 25 gram cuplikan <img alt=\"\\text{FeSO}_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BFeSO%7D_%7B4%7D\" /> (Mr = 152), diperlukan 6,125 gram <img alt=\"\\text{K}_{2}\\text{Cr}_{2}\\text{O}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BK%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%7BCr%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%7BO%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> (Mr = 294). Pada reaksi ini, ion dikromat berubah menjadi <img alt=\"\\text{Cr}^{3+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BCr%7D%5E%7B3&amp;plus;%7D\" /> , sedangkan <img alt=\"\\text{Fe}^{2+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BFe%7D%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D\" /> berubah menjadi <img alt=\"\\text{Fe}^{3+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BFe%7D%5E%7B3&amp;plus;%7D\" /> . Kadar <img alt=\"\\text{FeSO}_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BFeSO%7D_%7B4%7D\" /> dalam cuplikan di atas adalah<br />","choices":["19%","38%","48%","76%","92%"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkxOA"},{"id":"MjE3-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Volume larutan <img alt=\"\\text{H}_{3}\\text{PO}_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BH%7D_%7B3%7D%5Ctext%7BPO%7D_%7B4%7D\" /> 0,1 M yang tepat bereaksi dengan larutan 50 mL <img alt=\"\\text{Ba}_{3}\\text{(OH)}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BBa%7D_%7B3%7D%5Ctext%7B%28OH%29%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> 0,25 M adalah<br />","choices":["50 mL","83,3 mL","125 mL","150 mL","250 mL"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkxOQ"},{"id":"MjE3-q04","number":4,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara konfigurasi elektron berikut yang menunjukkan unsur logam adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624185006.jpg\" style=\"height:96px; width:185px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkyMA"},{"id":"MjE3-q05","number":5,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Struktur Lewis berikut ini:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624185040.jpg\" style=\"height:40px; width:121px\" /><br /> adalah representasi dari<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624185106.jpg\" style=\"height:102px; width:137px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkyMQ"},{"id":"MjE3-q06","number":6,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara senyawa alkana berikut ini yang mempunyai interaksi van der Waals paling tinggi adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624185139.jpg\" style=\"height:79px; width:148px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkyMg"},{"id":"MjE3-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika NaBr larut dalam air, maka jenis gaya antarmolekul yang harus diputuskan adalah<br />","choices":["Gaya ion-ion","Ikatan-Hidrogen","Gaya ion-dipol","Gaya ion-ion dan ikatan-Hidrogen","Dipol-dipol"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkyMw"},{"id":"MjE3-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara teknik teknik berikut ini yang tidak dapat digunakan untuk menghitung <img alt=\"\\Delta H_{reaksi}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5CDelta%20H_%7Breaksi%7D\" /> adalah<br />","choices":["Menggunakan panas pembentukan reaktan dan produk","Menggunakan titik leleh reaktan dan produk.","Hukum Hess","Menggunakan energi ikatan reaktan dan produk","Kalorimetri"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkyNA"},{"id":"MjE3-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara zat berikut ini<br /><br /> I. HCl(g)<br /> II. Na(s)<br /> III. HCl(aq)<br /> IV. <img alt=\"\\text{F}_{2}(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BF%7D_%7B2%7D%28g%29\" />(g)<br /><br /> yang mempunyai nilai entalpi pembentukan standard,&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\Delta H^{\\circ}_{f}=0\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5CDelta%20H%5E%7B%5Ccirc%7D_%7Bf%7D%3D0\" />&nbsp;adalah<br />","choices":["I, II, III, dan IV","I, II,dan IV","I dan II","II dan IV","Hanya II"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkyNQ"},{"id":"MjE3-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika diketahui data energi ikatan sebagai berikut: H-H = 436 kJ/mol, O-O = 142 kJ/mol, O=O = 499 kJ/mol dan H-O = 460 kJ/mol, maka entalpi reaksi pembentukan <img alt=\"\\text{H}_{2}\\text{O}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%7BO%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> adalah<br />","choices":["&ndash;127","&ndash; 209","&ndash; 484","&ndash; 841","+127"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkyNg"},{"id":"MjE3-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara padatan berikut ini, yang memiliki interaksi antarmolekul hanya melalui gaya van der Waals adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624185510.jpg\" style=\"height:105px; width:89px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkyNw"},{"id":"MjE3-q12","number":12,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika tekanan osmotik darah adalah 7,65 atm pada 37 oC, maka massa (dalam gram) glukosa (<img alt=\"C_{6}H_{12}O_{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_%7B6%7DH_%7B12%7DO_%7B6%7D\" />, massa molar = 180,2 g/mol) yang dibutuhkan untuk membuat 1,00 liter larutan injeksi intravenous yang tekanan osmotiknya sama dengan tekanan osmotik darah adalah<br />","choices":["3,00 g","4,44 g","25,4 g","45,3 g","56,0 g"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkyOA"},{"id":"MjE3-q13","number":13,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Larutan aseton dibuat dengan cara melarutkan 0,50 mol aseton <img alt=\"\\left(P^{\\circ}=345 \\text { torr }\\right)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cleft%28P%5E%7B%5Ccirc%7D%3D345%20%5Ctext%20%7B%20torr%20%7D%5Cright%29\" /> dalam 1,00 mol etanol <img alt=\"\\left(P^{\\circ}=59,8 \\text { torr }\\right)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cleft%28P%5E%7B%5Ccirc%7D%3D59%2C8%20%5Ctext%20%7B%20torr%20%7D%5Cright%29\" /> pada <img alt=\"25^{\\circ}\\text{C}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?25%5E%7B%5Ccirc%7D%5Ctext%7BC%7D\" />. Fraksi mol aseton dalam fasa uap di atas larutan tersebut adalah<br />","choices":["0,26","0,33","0,50","0,67","0,74"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkyOQ"},{"id":"MjE3-q14","number":14,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Telah diketahui bahwa sifat koligatif suatu larutan ditentukan oleh jumlah partikel zat terlarut. Anda melakukan percobaan untuk menentukan tekanan uap jenuh dari keempat larutan berikut ini:<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624190339.jpg\" style=\"height:66px; width:194px\" /><br /><br /> Berdasarkan berkurangnya tekanan uap larutan, maka urutan yang paling tepat adalah<br />","choices":["a &gt; b &gt; c &gt; d","b &gt; a &gt; b &gt; c","a &gt; d &gt; c &gt; b","a &gt; d &gt; b &gt; c","d &gt; c &gt; b &gt; a"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkzMA"},{"id":"MjE3-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Untuk reaksi fasa gas <img alt=\"3 \\mathrm{H}_{2}+\\mathrm{N}_{2} \\rightarrow 2 \\mathrm{NH}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?3%20%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D&amp;plus;%5Cmathrm%7BN%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Crightarrow%202%20%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B3%7D\" />, maka laju hilangnya <img alt=\"\\mathrm{H}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> dibandingkan terhadap laju pembentukan <img alt=\"\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B3%7D\" /> adalah<br />","choices":["Laju awalnya sama.","Laju hilangnya <img alt=\"\\mathrm{H}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> adalah 1/2 laju munculnya <img alt=\"\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B3%7D\" />.","Laju hilangnya <img alt=\"\\mathrm{H}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> adalah 3/2 laju munculnya <img alt=\"\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B3%7D\" />.","Laju hilangnya <img alt=\"\\mathrm{H}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> adalah 2/3 laju munculnya <img alt=\"\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B3%7D\" />.","Laju hilangnya <img alt=\"\\mathrm{H}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> adalah 1/3 laju munculnya <img alt=\"\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BNH%7D_%7B3%7D\" />."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkzMQ"},{"id":"MjE3-q16","number":16,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam suatu ruang tertutup pada suhu tertentu terdapat 0,02 mol gas <img alt=\"\\text{N}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BN%7D_%7B2%7D\" />; 0,06 mol gas <img alt=\"\\text{H}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> dan 0,05 mol gas <img alt=\"\\text{NH}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BNH%7D_%7B3%7D\" /> dalam keadaan setimbang. Jika ke dalam ruang dimasukkan 0,1 mol <img alt=\"\\text{Cr}_{2}\\text{O}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BCr%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%7BO%7D_%7B3%7D\" /> sebagai katalis, maka:<br />","choices":["Jumlah mol <img alt=\"\\text{N}_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BN%7D_%7B2%7D\" /> menjadi kurang dari 0,02","Jumlah mol <img alt=\"\\text{NH}_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BNH%7D_%7B3%7D\" /> menjadi 0,06 mol","Kesetimbangan bergeser ke kiri","Harga tetapan kesetimbangan K menjadi lebih besar","Susunan kesetimbangan tidak berubah"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkzMg"},{"id":"MjE3-q17","number":17,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Pada temperatur tetap, perbandingan konsentrasi gas-gas&nbsp;<img alt=\"SO_{2}: SO_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?SO_%7B2%7D%3A%20SO_%7B3%7D\" />&nbsp;dalam kesetimbangan reaksi&nbsp;<img alt=\"2 \\mathrm{SO}_{2}(\\mathrm{g})+\\mathrm{O}_{2}(\\mathrm{g}) \\rightleftharpoons 2 \\mathrm{SO}_{3}(\\mathrm{g})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%20%5Cmathrm%7BSO%7D_%7B2%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bg%7D%29&amp;plus;%5Cmathrm%7BO%7D_%7B2%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bg%7D%29%20%5Crightleftharpoons%202%20%5Cmathrm%7BSO%7D_%7B3%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bg%7D%29\" />,&nbsp;akan berbanding lurus dengan<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624191053.jpg\" style=\"height:99px; width:75px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkzMw"},{"id":"MjE3-q18","number":18,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jika anda mencampurkan natrium hidroksida, <img alt=\"\\text{NaOH}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BNaOH%7D\" />, dan asam asetat, <img alt=\"\\text{CH}_{3} \\text{CO}_{2} \\text{H}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BCH%7D_%7B3%7D%20%5Ctext%7BCO%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Ctext%7BH%7D\" /> dalam jumlah molar yang sama, maka spesi utama yang terdapat dalam larutan yang dihasilkan adalah Diketahui: <img alt=\"(\\left.K_{\\mathrm{a}\\text{ }} \\mathrm{CH}_{3} \\mathrm{CO}_{2} \\mathrm{H}=2 \\times 10^{-5}\\right)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28%5Cleft.K_%7B%5Cmathrm%7Ba%7D%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BCH%7D_%7B3%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BCO%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D%3D2%20%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-5%7D%5Cright%29\" /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624191353.jpg\" style=\"height:113px; width:238px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkzNA"},{"id":"MjE3-q19","number":19,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui: <img alt=\"\\text { Ksp CdS }=3,6 \\times 10^{-29} ; \\text {Ksp } Z n S=1,1 \\times 10^{-21}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%20%7B%20Ksp%20CdS%20%7D%3D3%2C6%20%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-29%7D%20%3B%20%5Ctext%20%7BKsp%20%7D%20Z%20n%20S%3D1%2C1%20%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-21%7D\" />.<br /> Tetapan kesetimbangan reaksi berikut:&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\mathrm{CdS}(\\mathrm{s})+\\mathrm{Zn}^{2+}(\\mathrm{aq}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{ZnS}(\\mathrm{s})+\\mathrm{Cd}^{2+}(\\mathrm{aq})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BCdS%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bs%7D%29&amp;plus;%5Cmathrm%7BZn%7D%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Baq%7D%29%20%5Crightleftharpoons%20%5Cmathrm%7BZnS%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Bs%7D%29&amp;plus;%5Cmathrm%7BCd%7D%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Baq%7D%29\" />&nbsp;adalah<br />","choices":["3,3 x <img alt=\"10^{-8}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B-8%7D\" />","2,7 x <img alt=\"10^{-4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B-4%7D\" />","4,2 x <img alt=\"10^{5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B5%7D\" />","2,5 x <img alt=\"10^{49}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B49%7D\" />","3,1 x <img alt=\"10^{7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5E%7B7%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkzNQ"},{"id":"MjE3-q20","number":20,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui bahwa <img alt=\"\\text{H}_{2}\\text{S}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%5Ctext%7BS%7D\" /> adalah asam yang lebih kuat daripada HCN.<br /><img alt=\"\\left(\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{S}: \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{a1}}=1,0 \\times 10^{-7} ; \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{a} 2}=1,3 \\times 10^{-13} ; \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{a}\\text{ }} \\mathrm{HCN}=6,0 \\times 10^{-10}\\right)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cleft%28%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BS%7D%3A%20%5Cmathrm%7BK%7D_%7B%5Cmathrm%7Ba1%7D%7D%3D1%2C0%20%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-7%7D%20%3B%20%5Cmathrm%7BK%7D_%7B%5Cmathrm%7Ba%7D%202%7D%3D1%2C3%20%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-13%7D%20%3B%20%5Cmathrm%7BK%7D_%7B%5Cmathrm%7Ba%7D%5Ctext%7B%20%7D%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BHCN%7D%3D6%2C0%20%5Ctimes%2010%5E%7B-10%7D%5Cright%29\" />&nbsp;<br /><br /> Tentukanlah, bila memungkinkan, ke arah manakah kesetimbangan berikut berada:&nbsp;<br /><img alt=\"\\mathrm{HCN}(\\mathrm{aq})+\\mathrm{HS}(\\mathrm{aq}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{CN}(\\mathrm{aq})+\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{S}(\\mathrm{aq})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cmathrm%7BHCN%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Baq%7D%29&amp;plus;%5Cmathrm%7BHS%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Baq%7D%29%20%5Crightleftharpoons%20%5Cmathrm%7BCN%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Baq%7D%29&amp;plus;%5Cmathrm%7BH%7D_%7B2%7D%20%5Cmathrm%7BS%7D%28%5Cmathrm%7Baq%7D%29\" /><br /><br /> &nbsp;</p>","choices":["Kesetimbangan mengarah ke kiri","Kesetimbangan mengarah ke kanan","Kesetimbangan sempurna setimbang ke arah kiri dan kanan","Dapat ditentukan bila keasaman relatif HS diketahui","Tidak dapat ditentukan"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkzNg"},{"id":"MjE3-q21","number":21,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara asam asam berikut ini yang mempunyai basa konjugasi paling kuat adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624192631.jpg\" style=\"height:103px; width:234px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkzNw"},{"id":"MjE3-q22","number":22,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Mengenai setengah reaksi berikut ini:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624192733.jpg\" style=\"height:24px; width:186px\" /><br /> Pernyataan yang tepat adalah<br />","choices":["Oksidasi klor","Oksidasi <img alt=\"\\text{H}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BH%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />","Reduksi klor","Reduksi <img alt=\"\\text{H}^{+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BH%7D%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D\" />","Auto reduksi-oksidasi"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkzOA"},{"id":"MjE3-q23","number":23,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Besarnya potensial sel <img alt=\"\\left(E^{0}_{s e l}\\right)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cleft%28E%5E%7B0%7D_%7Bs%20e%20l%7D%5Cright%29\" /> untuk reaksi berikut ini:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624193407.jpg\" style=\"height:55px; width:281px\" /><br /> adalah<br />","choices":["+0,74 V","+1,48 V","+2,26 V","&ndash;1,48 V","&ndash; 2,26 V"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODkzOQ"},{"id":"MjE3-q24","number":24,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara kelompok senyawa berikut yang termasuk aldehida, asam, dan alkohol (tidak perlu berurutan) adalah<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624193449.jpg\" style=\"height:99px; width:201px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODk0MA"},{"id":"MjE3-q25","number":25,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara kelima senyawa organik di bawah ini yang paling benar tatanamanya secara IUPAC adalah<br />","choices":["2-bromo-4-hidroksi-4-pentena","2-metil-1-pentena-4-ol","2-kloro-1,3-sikloheksadiena","2-metil-2-heksena-4-ol","5-metil,-sikloheksena-1-ol"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODk0MQ"},{"id":"MjE3-q26","number":26,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Urutan keasaman yang paling tepat untuk senyawa-senyawa berikut<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624193533.jpg\" style=\"height:93px; width:293px\" /><br /> adalah<br />","choices":["I &gt; III &gt; II","I &gt; II &gt; III","II &gt; I &gt; III","II &gt; III &gt; I","III &gt; I &gt; II"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODk0Mg"},{"id":"MjE3-q27","number":27,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Semua senyawa berikut ini mempunyai rumus molekul <img alt=\"\\text{C}_{4}\\text{H}_{10}\\text{O}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BC%7D_%7B4%7D%5Ctext%7BH%7D_%7B10%7D%5Ctext%7BO%7D\" /> dan merupakan isomer. Yang bukan isomer <img alt=\"\\text{C}_{4}\\text{H}_{10}\\text{O}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BC%7D_%7B4%7D%5Ctext%7BH%7D_%7B10%7D%5Ctext%7BO%7D\" /> adalah<br />","choices":["Butanon","Dietil eter","Metil propil eter","1-butanol","2-metil-2-propanol"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODk0Mw"},{"id":"MjE3-q28","number":28,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi kesetimbangan berikut ini :<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624193533.jpg\" style=\"height:93px; width:293px\" /><br /> Reaksi tersebut adalah:<br />","choices":["Reaksi substitusi","Reaksi adisi Markovnikov","Reaksi adisi anti Markovnikov","Reaksi eliminasi","Reaksi Radikal"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODk0NA"},{"id":"MjE3-q29","number":29,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika senyawa sikloheksena direaksikan dengan <img alt=\"\\left(B r_{2}, h v\\right)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cleft%28B%20r_%7B2%7D%2C%20h%20v%5Cright%29\" /> sebagaimana skema berikut:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624194004.jpg\" style=\"height:122px; width:180px\" /><br /> maka bromida dapat masuk pada posisi nomor<br />","choices":["Pada nomor 1 dan 6","Pada nomor 2 dan 3","Pada nomor 2 atau 5","Pada nomor 3 dan 4","Hanya 4"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODk0NQ"},{"id":"MjE3-q30","number":30,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara spesi berikut yang merupakan ion karbonium tersier adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200624194040.jpg\" style=\"height:122px; width:116px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/ODk0Ng"}]
